     "content_html": "greater urbanization led to quicker achievement of political equality for women"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171895,
     "content_html": "the original 13 states set the precedent for granting female suffrage"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171894,
     "content_html": "states with a higher percentage of Southern and Eastern European immigrants offered greater political equality for women"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171897,
     "content_html": "geography and suffrage equality were linked"
